# Read-only `kubectl diff` transcripts written into the repo ROOT by
# _k8s-drift-check (mail-cr-, list-stack-, form-stack-, archive-stack-,
# web-stack-drift.txt; the recipe writes "{{ label }}-drift.txt" relative to the
# justfile directory). They are live-cluster state, not repo content, and leaving
# them untracked keeps `_reviewed-clean-main` honest after a drift run. Rooted so
# a future docs/<name>-drift.txt is never silently swallowed.
/*-drift.txt

# Bazel convenience symlinks + lockfile for the org-tenancy cache proof workspace
bazel-*
bazel/flywheel-proof/bazel-*
bazel/flywheel-proof/MODULE.bazel.lock
